Convert aws downloaded airnow data to ioda nc file for RRFS-SD PM2.5 DA with baseline removed
Huiying Luo, last updated Mar 2025

How to:
1. source modulefile
2. Set time for conversion in driver_do_airnowioda_blrm.ksh; Set proper pathes, switch data download on/off in convert-airnow-blrm.ksh
3. ./driver_do_airnowioda_blrm.ksh  

Once run successfully, 
airnow-2024072000-blrm-v1.nc will be generated in testout

Info:
PM2.5 baseline is estimated from 2015-2024 obs using method adapted from O'Doherty et al. (2001) and Hung et al. (2019) 
Full year baseline will be shared on github, Jet, and Hera once available
Version 1 baseline for July is provided for testing in test folder as IODA_hourlyPM25baseline_88101_07_25rms.nc 

In test folder:
Version 1 baseline for July is provided for testing: IODA_hourlyPM25baseline_88101_07_25rms.nc
airnow obs: HourlyData_2024072000.dat (can be downloaded by scripts in convert-airnow-blrm.ksh)
site info: monitoring_site_locations_20240720.dat (can be downloaded by scripts in convert-airnow-blrm.ksh)

